---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const team = [
  {
    initials: 'LM',
    name: 'Lena Marsh, EA',
    role: 'Owner and preparer',
    text: 'Enrolled agent, licensed by the IRS to represent clients. Opened Tallybrook in 2004 after nine years at a national tax chain.',
  },
  {
    initials: 'RO',
    name: 'Ray Okafor',
    role: 'Preparer',
    text: 'Handles most of our self-employed and rental property clients. Fluent in rideshare mileage logs.',
  },
  {
    initials: 'DW',
    name: 'Dana Whitlock',
    role: 'Preparer and office manager',
    text: 'Books appointments, chases down missing forms, and prepares returns for retirees and families.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About | Tallybrook Tax Service, Columbus"
  description="Tallybrook Tax Service is a small, year-round tax office in Columbus, Ohio, opened in 2004 by enrolled agent Lena Marsh."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>A small tax office that stays open all year</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Lena Marsh opened Tallybrook in 2004 with one desk and a list of neighbors. Most of those
      neighbors still come back every winter.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap split split--narrow-left">
      <h2>Why we work this way</h2>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">
          At the chain, Lena's job was to finish returns fast and sell add-ons at the end. She
          wanted an office where people understood their own return and knew what it would cost
          before they sat down.
        </p>
        <p>
          So the fee is set up front. You keep the same preparer, who knows your situation and
          doesn't need it explained again. And the office stays open after April, because that's
          when the IRS letters show up.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your papers stay in the office or in our encrypted client portal. We never email Social
          Security numbers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">The people who'll do your return</h2>
      <ul class="team">
        {
          team.map((p) => (
            <li>
              <span class="team__badge" aria-hidden="true">
                {p.initials}
              </span>
              <h3>{p.name}</h3>
              <p class="team__role">{p.role}</p>
              <p>{p.text}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <dl class="facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Opened</dt>
          <dd>2004</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Returns each year</dt>
          <dd>About 1,400</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Clients who come back</dt>
          <dd>9 in 10</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Fee for an IRS letter on our returns</dt>
          <dd>$0</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .section-title {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .team {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .team {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .team li {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .team__badge {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 4.25rem;
    height: 4.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--box);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ledger);
    color: var(--ledger);
    font-family: var(--slab);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .team__role {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ledger);
  }

  .facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--white);
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .facts {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .facts div {
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.25rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .facts dt {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--slab);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--ledger);
  }
</style>
